\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Crawlers hitting 
\f2\fs26 /funds/*
\f1\fs24  triggering live Gemini LLM calls, 1.5MB AMFI splits, multi-year NAV downloads, and unbounded caches (
\f2\fs26 _FUNDAMENTALS_CACHE
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 FUND_AUDIT_TASKS
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 _CONTACT_RATE_BUCKETS
\f1\fs24 , DataFrames).\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'95 
\f3\b\fs26 INV_ASYM_ROUTE_COST
\f1\b0\fs24 : Flags unauthenticated GET endpoints triggering heavy synchronous computations, external syncs, or LLM clients.\
\'95 
\f3\b\fs26 INV_UNBOUNDED_CACHE
\f1\b0\fs24 : AST scanner flagging module-level dicts/lists without maxsize/eviction.\
\'95 
\f3\b\fs26 INV_MEM_PROFILE_SPIKE
\f1\b0\fs24 : Automatic memory profiling (
\f2\fs26 tracemalloc
\f1\fs24 ) across crawler-targeted routes.\cell \row

