\f0\b \cf0 3. Proactive Incentive & Adversarial Rigor
\f1\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Risk of auditors becoming complacent or, conversely, spamming trivial false alarms under perverse incentives.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'95 
\f0\b Invariant-Driven Heuristics
\f1\b0 : Replaces brittle hardcoded checks with general rules.\
\'95 
\f0\b Empirical Verification Requirement
\f1\b0 : A finding is only logged if accompanied by an automated, reproducible test or proof.\
\'95 
\f0\b Severity Weighting
\f1\b0 : Critical operational risks (OOM, DB crash) are separated from cosmetic items.\cell \row

