\f0\b \cf0 5. Non-Blocking Scoring & Reporting
\f1\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 How to handle failed items without breaking scheduled pipelines.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'95 
\f0\b Composite Health Scoring
\f1\b0  (e.g., 84/100 Grade B).\
\'95 
