\f0\b \cf0 6. Front-End / UI / UX Rigor
\f1\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Ensuring user-visible issues are caught (mobile layout, dark mode, trapped modals, broken interactions).\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
